{"id":33,"gn":"Pokémon Vénépic","ft":["D’un tempérament violent, il empale l’ennemi sur sa corne qui distille un poison puissant.","Il dresse ses oreilles à l’affût d’un bruit suspect et attaque toute menace se rapprochant de lui.","Très agressif, il est prompt à répondre à la violence. La corne sur sa tête est venimeuse.","Nidorino dispose d’une corne plus dure que du diamant. S’il sent une présence hostile, toutes les pointes de son dos se hérissent d’un coup, puis il défie son ennemi.","Sa corne est venimeuse. Si elle perce un ennemi, elle lui injecte un poison violent.","Il erre à la recherche d’une Pierre Lune, brisant tous les rochers sur son passage avec sa corne plus solide qu’un diamant.","D’un naturel nerveux, il est prompt à se battre. Lorsqu’il a une montée d’adrénaline, la concentration de son poison augmente."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":2,"25":3,"26":3,"31":4,"32":4,"33":5,"34":6},"gr":0,"cr":120,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Monstrueux","Terrestre"],"gw":"medium-slow","gm":{"swcrown":[0,69],"sw":[2,69],"lgpe":[0,33],"xy":[1,108],"hgss":[0,99],"frlg":[0,33],"c":[0,99],"gs":[0,99],"y":[0,33],"rb":[0,33]},"f":{"33":{"n":"Nidorino","t":["poison"],"s":[61,72,57,55,55,65],"h":0.9,"w":19.5,"a":[[38,0],[79,0],[55,1]],"ps":[[1,[61,72,57,55,55,65]]],"pa":[[3,[[38,0]]],[4,[[38,0],[79,0]]]],"av":["swcrown","sw","lgpe","xy","hgss","frlg","c","gs","y","rb"],"ls":[{"l":[[43,1],[40,1],[64,1],[116,1],[31,15],[390,22],[24,29],[30,36],[270,43],[92,50],[260,57],[398,64],[414,71]],"m":[34,58,59,85,87,91,116,133,156,164,168,173,182,188,203,213,214,231,240,241,251,263,270,390,398,414,421,474,496,529,599,684,707]},{"l":[[43,1],[64,1],[116,1],[40,1],[116,3],[40,6],[24,9],[30,12],[270,15],[92,23],[31,31],[398,39],[32,47]],"m":[29,58,59,85,87,91,92,115,156,164,182,188,231,263,270,398,529]},{"l":[[43,1],[64,1],[116,7],[24,9],[40,13],[31,20],[30,23],[270,28],[390,35],[260,38],[398,43],[445,50],[32,58]],"m":[15,58,59,70,85,87,91,92,104,156,164,168,182,188,207,213,214,216,218,237,24